---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy policy — Grossline">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="lede">Last updated: 5 September 2026</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    When a merchant engages Grossline, we access their Shopify order data, Google Ads cost data
    and Meta Ads spend data, using read-only credentials the merchant grants us. We also keep the
    contact details the merchant gives us (name, email address).
  </p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>
    Platform data is used solely to compute reporting metrics and produce reports for the merchant
    it belongs to. We do not sell data, share one merchant's data with another, use it for
    advertising, or build cross-merchant profiles.
  </p>

  <h2>How it is protected</h2>
  <p>
    Access credentials are encrypted at rest. Each merchant's data is isolated at the database
    level. Access is limited to the analyst preparing the merchant's reports.
  </p>

  <h2>Retention and deletion</h2>
  <p>
    Data is kept while the engagement is active. When a merchant leaves, their platform
    credentials are revoked and their data is deleted on request to
    <a href="mailto:hello@getgrossline.com">hello@getgrossline.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:hello@getgrossline.com">hello@getgrossline.com</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
